{"id":"0db3b10b66b27b20","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-ordinal-transitive.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal Transitive","display":"df-zfc-ordinal-transitive — ZFC Ordinal Transitive","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal-transitive","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal-transitive"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal-transitive — ZFC Ordinal Transitive","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal-transitive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal-transitive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal-transitive — ZFC Ordinal Transitive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> (set candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdinalTransitive}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdinalTransitive}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrdinalTransitive}_S(\\alpha)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\alpha\\;(x\\subseteq\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrdinalTransitive}_S(\\alpha)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\alpha\\;(x\\subseteq\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Transitivity alone does not characterize ordinals; the ordinal guard is now explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdinalTransitive}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrdinalTransitive}_S(\\alpha)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\alpha\\;(x\\subseteq\\alpha).","display":true}],"bytes":825,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2987","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-ordinal-transitive.md|58-df-zfc-ordinal-transitive]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5582a281f15a33c2"]}